    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/street-food-truck/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Street Food Truck is a dynamic theme specifically designed for mobile kitchens, food carts, pop-up restaurants, snack bars, and street food vendors, making it the perfect option for gourmet street food operators and catering businesses aiming to establish high-converting online stores. This theme integrates seamlessly with WooCommerce, enabling the sale of street food merchandise, digital menus, meal bundles, and catering packages, all while capturing the vibrant spirit of street food culture. It allows you to showcase your restaurant menu, promote local events, and highlight regional cuisine, fostering a connection with your community through bold visuals, vibrant colors, and customizable layouts that enhance user experience across various devices. Customers can easily locate food truck spots, book catering services, and explore a variety of street food specialties. The theme also includes image and video galleries to display tempting food photos and promotional clips, along with social media integration to boost engagement, Contact Form 7 for booking inquiries, and Yoast SEO compatibility to improve search rankings for terms like food truck catering and mobile food truck services. With its perfect combination of style and functionality, this theme is designed to elevate your street food business and broaden your reach in the growing market for street food and mobile kitchens. Demo: https://www.vwthemes.net/vw-street-food-truck/."
    },
